#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:5
msgid "Add row to title block"
msgstr "在图框中添加行"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech `title block editor`_ allows adding `row`_ from `menu bar`_ and"
" `drawing area`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 允许通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 和 `绘图区 "
"<drawing area_>`_ 添加 `行 <row_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:10
msgid "Add row from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏添加行"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:12
msgid "Select **Edit > Add a row** menu item to add a new `row`_ below."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 添加行** 菜单项，在下方添加新的 `行 <row_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:17
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor, edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器，编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:21
msgid ""
"Adding a new `row`_ at top or middle from `title block`_ can only be done "
"from `drawing area`_."
msgstr ""
"在 `图框 <title block_>`_ 的顶部或中间添加新的 `行 <row_>`_ 只能通过 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ "
"完成。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:25
msgid "Add row from drawing area"
msgstr "从绘图区添加行"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:27
msgid ""
"Right click on the head from the `row`_ below or above the position where "
"the new `row`_ should be placed."
msgstr "在应放置新 `行 <row_>`_ 的位置上方或下方，右键单击 `行 <row_>`_ 的行头。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:28
msgid ""
"Click the option **Add a row (before)** or **Add a row (after)** to add a "
"new `row`_ above or below the selected `row`_."
msgstr ""
"单击选项 **添加行（之前）** 或 **添加行（之后）** ，即可在选定 `行 <row_>`_ 的上方或下方添加新的 `行 <row_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_add.rst:33
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor, drawing area"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器，绘图区"
